'''Jiggig Dungeon''' is a dungeon in [[Jiggig]]. The dungeon is a large area swarming with [[zogre]]s and [[skogre]]s. The player can access it by climbing over [[crushed barricade]] and then climbing down the [[Stairs (Jiggig Dungeon)|stairs]]. They can only be climbed during and after the [[Zogre Flesh Eaters]] quest.

The main points of interest during the Zogre Flesh Eaters quest are the [[Skeleton (Zogre Flesh Eaters)|skeleton]] lying on a [[broken lectern]] in the north-west corner, and the entrance to the level below to the west. The locked [[ogre stone door]]s can only be opened during the quest, using the [[ogre gate key]] given to the player by [[Grish]]. The player will find [[Slash Bash]] in the bottom level.

There are many [[Ogre Coffin|ogre coffin]]s scattered inside the wall and on the ground. They can be opened either with an [[ogre coffin key]], which is a drop from zogres and skogres, or by picking the locks through the [[Thieving]] skill.

When burying [[zogre]] bones in the dungeon, there's a 1 in 3 chance and to spawn a [[skogre]] alongside the regular experience drop. The skogre will despawn after 5 minutes. A message in the chatbox appears {{Mes|The creature rises from the grave... again!}}.

==Transportation==
* [[Ring of dueling]] teleport to [[Castle Wars]] then run south to Jiggig.
* Using [[Fairy ring]] code {{fairycode|BKP}} and running east.

